# FRIDAY - AI Desktop Assistant
# Environment Variables Template
# 
# INSTRUCTIONS:
# 1. Copy this file: cp .env.example .env (or copy .env.example .env on Windows)
# 2. Edit .env and replace the placeholder values with your actual API keys
# 3. Never commit .env to GitHub (it's protected by .gitignore)

# OpenAI API Key - Required for AI mode
# Get it from: https://platform.openai.com/api-keys
OPENAI_API_KEY=your-openai-api-key-here

# News API Key - Optional (for news features)
# Get it from: https://newsapi.org
NEWS_API_KEY=your-news-api-key-here

